<title>USA: ITT Educational votes 3-for-2 split.</title>
<headline>ITT Educational votes 3-for-2 split.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>ITT Educational Services Inc said directors voted a three-for-two stock split, payable November 4, record October 21.</p>
<p>The split will increase the company's shares outstanding to 27 million.</p>
<p>ITT Corp owns 83.3 percent of the common stock of ITT Educational.</p>
<p>ITT Educational closed yesterday at 39-1/8, a 52-week high.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk 312 408 8787</p>
</text>
